From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Shulga <igo.shulga@macbook-lf73jk0j09.t-oblako.ru>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:42:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] session runtime isolation

What: Preserve the repository-owned session runtime isolation.
Why: Ombra embeds multiple concurrent sessions and renders native host features.
Upstream-status: Ombra-only integration; generic safety fixes are upstream candidates.

